r identities.","oracle_id":"0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838","published_at":"2020-11-10","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet's ability produces no mana. It doesn't produce {C}.","oracle_id":"0bc7f093-bef0-4f1a-852c-4b75ebf54838","published_at":"2020-11-10","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.","oracle_id":"a7e97fa9-4b72-4548-b854-5be5f18a6f1a","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"An Equipment that becomes a copy of a creature becomes unattached if it was attached to a creature. An Equipment that becomes a copy of another Equipment remains attached if it was attached to a creature.","oracle_id":"cc6e6e16-da2b-4fc0-91ad-b76f0a101306","published_at":"2019-07-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Becoming a copy won't change whether an artifact is a token.","oracle_id":"cc6e6e16-da2b-4fc0-91ad-b76f0a101306","published_at":"2019-07-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the target artifact is copying something else, then your artifacts become copies of whatever the target artifact copied.","oracle_id":"cc6e6e16-da2b-4fc0-91ad-b76f0a101306","published_at":"2019-07-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Masterful Replication copies the printed values of the target artifact. It won't copy counters on that artifact or effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Notably, it won't copy effects that made the target artifact become an artifact creature if it isn't normally an artifact creature.","oracle_id":"cc6e6e16-da2b-4fc0-91ad-b76f0a101306","published_at":"2019-07-12","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
